    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21901" root="شخص" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَخِيصٌ</span></b>  <i>Big, bulky,</i> or <i>corpulent:</i> (S, K, TA:)
or <i>great in</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَخْص</span> [or <i>person</i>] <i>and make:</i> (TA:)
applied to a man: (S:) fem. with <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ة</span>; (S, A, K;)
applied to a woman. (S, A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A lord, master,
chief, man of rank</i> or <i>quality,</i> or <i>a personage.</i>
(AZ, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَنْطِقٌ شَخِيصٌ</span> (tropical:)  <i>Sour, crabbed,</i> or
<i>austere, speech.</i> (Ibn-'Abbád, A, K. [See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شَخِيسٌ</span>.])

